ion of the aforementioned.) Bachelor’s degree from an accredited four- year college or university. Additional Job Information Full job description. To Apply: Please email a résumé, a minimum of three professional references and job application . Finalist(s) will be required to undergo a background check. Exempt - Other Footer Holder Footer Logo Footer Address 900 N. Grand Avenue Sherman TX 75090 903-813-2000 Socials Facebook (opens in new window/tab) YouTube (opens in new window/tab) Instagram (opens in new window/tab) LinkedIn (opens in new window/tab) Quick Links Campus Conduct Hotline Mental Health Resources Human Resources Title IX Office Consumer Information Connect Request Info (opens in new window/tab) Subscribe (opens in new window/tab) Contact Us Directory Login Student Portal (opens in new window/tab) Employee Portal (opens in new window/tab) Outlook Email (opens in new window/tab) Self-Service (opens in new window/tab) Footer Statement Austin College is committed to equal opportunity and does not discriminate on the basis of age, color, disability, national origin, race, religion, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, citizenship status, genetic information, status as a veteran, or any other characteristic that is protected by applicable state or federal law in its operations, employment opportunities, educational programs, and related activities. This commitment is supported by policies applied in a manner consistent with governing state and federal regulations. The following people have been designated to handle complaints: For all Students, Employees, and Others: Melanie Oelfke Powered by Finalsite"
